{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55715","headline":"昇山灵岩寺（题拟） · 钱昱","name":"昇山灵岩寺（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松杉满寺廊，栏杆倚高冈。\n郡郭晓云漠，禅斋春草长。\n涧青连竹色，山静带茶香。\n更有名僧在，茅庵住上方。\n（见《淳熙三山志》卷三八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55715.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55715","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}